d academy dedicated to nurturing refined ladies and gentlemen, so girls are required to take ballroom dancing and tea party classes. Since Monica lived in isolation in a mountain cabin for a long time, she must re-take her ballroom dance test. Monica was already struggling, and to make matters worse, the tea party announcement was made. Her group is Monica’s friends Lana Colette and Casey Grove, as well as Claudia who is an intelligent woman known as the “walking library.” How will the tea party and Monica’s re-examination for the ballroom dance go?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11219943/screencap/6891cba55602d.jpg"},{"title":"A Jealous Noblewoman","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18795","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"179966","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"59459","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"281058","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452832","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"100159","synopsis":"The ballroom dance re-examination test is over, so Monica is having a barbecue with Glenn and the others.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11219944/screencap/689b0c5ca34ae.jpg"},{"title":"My Responsibility","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18795","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"179966","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"59459","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"281058","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452832","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"100349","synopsis":"Monica is attending school for the first time in a week, so Lana and Casey hold a welcome back party for her. Claudia also joins and the girls 